   "textKind": "explain",
   "content": "**Nature gets the bigger share of heritage spending in only four countries:**\n\n- **Colombia:** 90% (2023)\n- **Estonia:** 72% (2021)\n- **Georgia:** 69% (2021)\n- **Ecuador:** 52% (2024)\n\nIn the other 14 of the 18 countries with comparable data, cultural heritage gets more. Blank countries have no comparable data. Source: UIS, February 2026 release.",
